                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.512/423: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Mayer</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1926-10-23T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 23,
                                1926—5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>243. Your 507, October 23, 7 p.m. You will be correct in assuming that Department
                    is unwilling to join in draft formula presented in paragraph 2 of your 497,
                    October 20.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
